# Line endings are pinned to LF in the repository.
#
# The working tree is already all-LF, but Windows Git defaults to `core.autocrlf=true`,
# which would rewrite files on checkout and produce whole-file diffs for whoever opens
# this project next on a different platform. Being explicit here means the bytes in the
# repository are the bytes on disk, on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# Keep the lockfile out of diff summaries — it is generated, and a three-line change
# to package.json can rewrite hundreds of lines of it.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
